ready: 1
kind: quality
id: recall.quality.context-budget
display_id: QC-RECALL-BUDGET
module: recall
title: Context Kernle adds
applies_to:
  - recall.seq.session-index
  - recall.seq.cue
  - recall.seq.gut-check
  - recall.seq.load
measure: Tokens Kernle adds to the agent's context per session, per prompt and per tool call
target: >-
  Session index within its budget, cues within their budget per prompt, at most
  the maximum number of guardrails per tool call, a load within the caller's
  budget, and nothing at all when nothing qualifies
